Creates a color value from the given hexadecimal string.
Supported formats are: RGB, RRGGBB, RRGGBBAA, #RGB, #RRGGBB, #RRGGBBAA
@param HexString - The hexadecimal string.
@return The corresponding color value.
@see ToHex

